{"id":2337,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><style></style><div><p>初夏五月，生机盎然。为践行全民健身战略，增强教职工身体素质，丰富教职工业余文化生活，凝聚奋进力量，5 月 23 日，中北大学 2026 年教职工运动会在主操场隆重举行，我院数十余名教职工齐聚赛场，共赴这场活力盛宴。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MR7VYnlnkolCbM2RNsMmlPnzVVUzLdYMlLYoRLsLNlYnNL0gihFp2hmCIa0okyPUYyZoky8MNCinNU4L4N8M4NiU4lZMzGsL8l8M8-bMRMFozVVU4vDnRTFMNUZL4NJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4Mz9aMYbw62-8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35807&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/81C8846F5FD3394795C585073E47B943/91EC76D9/6D839\" vheight=\"368.2699890136719\" vwidth=\"553.530029296875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7nzMV2LlLbUNCYU2NUDMzUDUmnfn7ldaLRUsLm98LmvZM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ysnkhfnkyiL4v8LN7YUlQ7nzNYMzrkMlMRLm-snzlaMz6Fn7Laoz6Vo7WFU8V7olM7gtXaQIveo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g47PL4G0L4lZLRvJqd-nx&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35807&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>开幕式现场彩旗飘扬、氛围热烈。我院代表队身着整齐服装，迈着矫健步伐依次入场，口号铿锵、精神抖擞，充分展现了机械工程学院教职工昂扬向上的精神风貌。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7L8MVRM7CYLRvZL2mVkLm6fU4vsnl-diU4n2M4GZn7CYol-0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7nSyDUSyiMzUbLNnRLzliozTknlr2Um62L8lsnRNbUzAFozvYLll8UzrFnzCPU1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioRGsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35807&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1DE6A55492DC15599BEEFB7F3E7D99A8/9721E4A5/E61B\" vheight=\"368.2699890136719\" vwidth=\"553.530029296875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7L8MVRM7CYLRvZL2mVkLm6fU4vsnl-diU4n2M4GZn7CYol-0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7nSyDUSyiMzUbLNnRLzliozTknlr2Um62L8lsnRNbUzAFozvYLll8UzrFnzCPU1b/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LioRGsgtA8pU-cc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35807&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次运动会设置 16 个集体项目与 6 个个人项目，兼顾竞技性与趣味性。跑道上，运动员身姿矫健、全力冲刺；趣味项目中，“鹊桥相会”“赶猪跑”“集体跳绳” 等比赛精彩纷呈，大家默契配合、团结协作，赛场内外欢声笑语、掌声不断。全体运动员奋勇争先、文明参赛，裁判员公正执裁、一丝不苟，工作人员各司其职、贴心服务，保障赛事有序推进。</p><p>经过全体成员齐心协力，奋力拼搏，我院教职工在“齐心协力”、“赶猪跑”、“立定跳远”等项目中取得优异成绩。不仅展示了我院教职工优异的体能与风采，更体现了其团结协作精神。</p><p>此次运动会，不仅为我院教职工搭建了强身健体、放松身心的平台，更有效增进了教职工之间的沟通交流，极大地增强了学院的凝聚力、向心力和战斗力。未来，全院教职工将把赛场上团结拼搏、奋勇争先、永不言弃的体育精神，融入立德树人、科研创新、教书育人的各项工作中，以更饱满的热情、更昂扬的斗志、更务实的作风履职尽责、深耕细作，奋力推动学院各项事业高质量发展。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7U4UV8nNn7UzUso2zQfoz7sMmG4nNLdbLmMkUzNYU8-4nm90gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4MSyYL1hVLmLZL8LZnzA2UNCaU4nVM4v4U8rfozN4MmQFM4nVM7CDUzAFLzW7U4-JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4Mz9aMYbw62-8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35807&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/43522E2383C8E8FBF0C4E773CEA99366/74E4F6A8/12DC2\" vheight=\"368.2699890136719\" vwidth=\"552.469970703125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7U4UV8nNn7UzUso2zQfoz7sMmG4nNLdbLmMkUzNYU8-4nm90gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4MSyYL1hVLmLZL8LZnzA2UNCaU4nVM4v4U8rfozN4MmQFM4nVM7CDUzAFLzW7U4-JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4Mz9aMYbw62-8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35807&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=7MR7VYnlnkolCbM2RNsMmlPnzVVUzLdYMlLYoRLsLNlYnNL0gihFp2hmCIa0okyPUYyZoky8MNCinNU4L4N8M4NiU4lZMzGsL8l8M8-bMRMFozVVU4vDnRTFMNUZL4NJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4Mz9aMYbw62-8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=35807&e=.jpeg"}